# >>> THE DEBRIS OF AN INVESTIGATION DOES NOT LIVE IN THE SOURCE TREE.
#
# A one-off probe script and the files it leaves behind belong in the scratch working area,
# where they are thrown away with the question that prompted them. `*.log` already caught some
# of it, which is why the rest went unnoticed for weeks: eight such files accumulated directly
# in `projects/` - two probe scripts, their done-files and output, a 2 MB replay screenshot and
# a stray directory holding one error message.
#
# Ignoring them is the smaller half of the rule. The larger half is not writing them here.
*.done
*.out
capsule.png

# The stand-in for the console system font, if a deployment supplies one. Never
# committed: whichever face is dropped here belongs to whoever licensed it, and the
# project ships no font of its own. See vitaslop-runtime/src/font/system.rs.
projects/vitaslop-web/web/system-font.ttf
